/sun-en">Sun En</a>'s Daoist rebellion breaks out in the coastal south</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">403</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/huan-xuan">Huan Xuan</a> usurps the throne as emperor of Chu</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">417</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/emperor-wu-of-liu-song">Liu Yu</a>'s army conquers the Later <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/qin-dynasty">Qin</a> and takes <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/changan">Chang'an</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">420</span><span class="rf-text">Emperor Gong abdicates to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/emperor-wu-of-liu-song">Liu Yu</a>, founder of the Liu <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/song-dynasty">Song</a></span></li></ol>
